    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552610/extras/cf3e1d7d04bfea50465485a7f6de9e6a.avif?t=1753254057\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take the dare and risk it all!</strong> Battle waves of relentless, clothes-eating slimes summoned by your opponent. Upgrade your spellbook to unlock powerful spells and special abilities to keep your clothes\u2014and your pride\u2014intact. Can you outwit your opponent and become the ultimate witch, or will you lose the dare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552610/extras/32f44b917ab9904fac58c738e7778f15.poster.avif?t=1753254057\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552610/extras/32f44b917ab9904fac58c738e7778f15.webm?t=1753254057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552610/extras/32f44b917ab9904fac58c738e7778f15.mp4?t=1753254057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witchy Dare</strong> is a steamy survival game featuring vibrant gameplay and roguelite mechanics. Play as Maria, a talented fox witch, as she uncovers her mother\u2019s mysterious magical legacy while facing off against rival witches determined to put an end to her magical journey.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552610/extras/cf3e1d7d04bfea50465485a7f6de9e6a.avif?t=1753254057\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take the dare and risk it all!</strong> Battle waves of relentless, clothes-eating slimes summoned by your opponent. Upgrade your spellbook to unlock powerful spells and special abilities to keep your clothes\u2014and your pride\u2014intact. Can you outwit your opponent and become the ultimate witch, or will you lose the dare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552610/extras/32f44b917ab9904fac58c738e7778f15.poster.avif?t=1753254057\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552610/extras/32f44b917ab9904fac58c738e7778f15.webm?t=1753254057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552610/extras/32f44b917ab9904fac58c738e7778f15.mp4?t=1753254057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witchy Dare</strong> is a steamy survival game featuring vibrant gameplay and roguelite mechanics. Play as Maria, a talented fox witch, as she uncovers her mother\u2019s mysterious magical legacy while facing off against rival witches determined to put an end to her magical journey.</p>",
